{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41477","headline":"寺居陆处士相访感怀却寄二三友人 · 李建勳","name":"寺居陆处士相访感怀却寄二三友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘寺闲居亦半年，就中昨夜好潸然。\n人归远岫疎钟後，雪打高杉古屋前。\n投足正逢他国乱，冥心未解祖师禅。\n炉烟向冷孤灯下，唯有寒吟到曙天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41477.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41477","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}